<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,662 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 118.47 pence a kilo against 113.29 last week and 102.78 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 111,302 pkgs sold so far this year is 128.12 pence against 112.26 pence for the 153,746 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
</text>
